Shepherd/Resources/Content/web.json is the World English Bible (WEB), 66-book
edition "engwebp", converted without changes to its text from eBible.org
(https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp; source pinned by SHA-256 in
tools/bible/build_web.py). The World English Bible is in the public domain.
"World English Bible" is a trademark of eBible.org and is used here only to
identify this faithful copy; if the text is ever changed, it must no longer be
called the World English Bible.
